and proposed appearance would not be in keeping with existing size or appearance
of properties along Gilwell Close and would appear overly dominant, and have a subduing
effect to the appearance of the existing dwellings which would negatively alter
the street-scene and character of the area and therefore the proposal is not
supported by Policy 53 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024) and D1 or D4 of the London
Plan (2021). &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
