proposed development due to its sitting and size would detrimentally harm the
amenity of neighbouring occupiers at no.2 Gilwell Close in terms of loss of sunlight,
outlook, and creating a sense of enclosure. Such development is not compliant
with policy 57 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024). &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
