scheme would not have a detrimentally negative impact on biodiversity and urban
greening or the Epping Forest Special Area of Conservation and thus the
development is not in accordance with policy 79, 80 and 81 of Waltham Forests
LP1 (2024).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
